    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You can expend a use of your Channel Divinity to cast Shield of Faith or Spiritual Weapon instead of expending a spell slot. Cast this way, the spell doesn't require Concentration; instead it lasts 1 minute, but it ends early if you cast that spell again, have the Incapacitated condition, or die.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-80UB5IfBJE4s6HEZ\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>Cast the spell from your sheet without a slot and end the Concentration it begins.</p></section>",
